<title>USA: FutureNet in deal with Philips.</title>
<headline>FutureNet in deal with Philips.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>FutureNet Inc said it and Philips Electronics NV's Philips Consumer Electronics Company have concluded an agreement to market Philips Magnavox Internet TV Terminal units through FutureNet's network marketing program.</p>
<p>Philips introduced the units as part of a licensee agreement with Web TV Networks Inc to provide the Web TV Network on-line service via Internet access over television. The WebTV Network service is sold primarily through consumer electronics stores.</p>
</text>
